 "texts": [
  "So you are the one who chased the HOLLOW ORDER out of every corner of VARROW. / I am ELOWEN, CHAMPION of the SUMMIT. Give me everything you have.",
  "REN has no more usable Wildkin!",
  "REN panicked and dropped $1477... REN blacked out!",
  "Your Wildkin were brought back to the HAVEN and fully restored.",
  "Welcome to the HAVEN! Shall I restore your Wildkin to full health?",
  "Okay, I'll take your Wildkin for a moment.",
  "Your Wildkin are fully rested. Come back anytime!",
  "Final supplies before the ELITE FOUR!",
  "Thank you! Please come again!",
  "Beyond these stairs wait the ELITE FOUR and the CHAMPION. / Once you go up, there is no turning back until you win, or fall.",
  "THORNE: Go. The next door is open.",
  "WREN: Fly on, then.",
  "MORRIGAN: Go on. VESPER will not be so gentle.",
  "ELOWEN: You and your Wildkin fought as one. / That is the heart of a true CHAMPION. / ELOWEN: From this day, your name is carved into the SUMMIT, REN.",
  "PROF. FENN: REN! I climbed all the way up the mountain! / You did it! I'm so proud of you.",
  "VEX: Heh. Guess I'll just have to become CHAMPION after you. / Congrats, REN.",
  "MOM: Welcome home, CHAMPION! Tell me everything! / ...But rest first. Your Wildkin are all healed up.",
  "Save your game?",
  "REN saved the game!",
  "Your adventure continues! / The storms around the RIFT north of DRIFTWOOD CAPE have calmed. / Complete the WILDEX, and challenge the LEAGUE again anytime.",
  "MOM: Oh, you look worn out! Take a little rest.",
  "MOM: My child, the CHAMPION! I'm so proud of you!",
  "A show about a young trainer crossing a vast desert with a Wildkin. / Gripping stuff!",
  "A shelf of comics about heroic Wildkin.",
  "MOM's cookbooks. One is titled '101 Snacks Wildkin Love'.",
  "HEARTHVALE: Where every journey starts warm.",
  "PROF. FENN'S WILDKIN LAB",
  "Ah, you have a partner now! / The sea to the south leads to CINDERMOOR, if you ever find a way to cross it.",
  "VEX's house",
  "JUNE: Grandma says every Wildkin has a story. / I hope you find lots of them!",
  "Shelves of travel guides and old Wildkin almanacs.",
  "PROF. FENN: Eight badges! / You deserve the last Wildkin from my lab. / It has been waiting so patiently.",
  "REN received SPROUTLE!",
  "Give a nickname to SPROUTLE?",
  "SPROUTLE was sent to the LINK TERMINAL storage.",
  "PROF. FENN: CHAMPION REN! Your WILDEX has 51 entries. / Can you find all 151?",
  "This pod is empty now.",
  "Weaken wild Wildkin before you throw a pod. / Status problems help too!",
  "PROF. FENN's last Wildkin rests in this pod. It looks content.",
  "I am an aide to PROF. FENN. / She was the one who first charted all fifteen Wildkin types!",
  "A machine that analyzes Wildkin DNA. It beeps cheerfully.",
  "Research notes: 'Some Wildkin evolve only when they touch a special shard.'",
  "A humming research machine. Its screen shows a map of VARROW.",
  "Research notes: 'FLAME beats LEAF. LEAF beats TIDE. TIDE beats FLAME.'",
  "ROUTE 1 North: THICKET WOODS South: HEARTHVALE",
  "You can hop down ledges, but you can never climb back up them!",
  "The water is calm. Ride the DRIFTBOARD?",
  "Welcome to the MARKET! How can I help?",
  "HYPER POTION, and you want 4? That'll be $6000. OK?",
  "Here you are! Thank you!",
  "Bottles of POTION in every size.",
  "Neatly stacked boxes of CAPTURE PODS.",
  "A display of hiking gear.",
  "VULK locked the GYM and lost the key in the old MANOR fire. / Typical VULK!",
  "Wildkin grow fastest when they battle often. / That candy was just a little push!",
  "The LAB can revive Wildkin from fossils. Bring any you find!",
  "SCIENTIST: Oh! That is a SPIRAL FOSSIL! / Shall I revive the Wildkin inside?",
  "SCIENTIST: Into the machine it goes... whirr... clunk... ding!",
  "REN received SPIRALITH!",
  "Give a nickname to SPIRALITH?",
  "SPIRALITH was sent to the LINK TERMINAL storage.",
  "We study the RIFT here. / Old records say a Wildkin from before all others sleeps beyond it.",
  "A FOSSIL REVIVER. Its glass tank bubbles quietly.",
  "A machine humming with readings from the northern sea.",
  "CINDERMOOR ISLAND: Forged in fire, tempered by the sea.",
  "VULK's FLAME team can't stand TIDE, EARTH and STONE moves. / LEAF and FROST moves will barely tickle them!",
  "CINDERMOOR GYM LEADER: VULK The flame that never dies!",
  "The EMBER CALDERA in the volcano is where the dawn phoenix is said to nest. / Only fools go in. Fools and trainers.",
  "REN booted up the LINK TERMINAL.",
  "VULK says FLAME types are weak to TIDE, EARTH and STONE. / He says it like it is a secret.",
  "Krrraaaah! A wave of heat rolls over you! / The dawn phoenix spreads its wings!",
  "SOLMARA soared up out of the caldera! / It might come back if you return later.",
  "A charred journal: 'The RIFT is not a place. It is a door. / And something is knocking.'",
  "A journal: 'Day 61. / The creature from the RIFT spoke to me without words. It is lonely. / It wants out.'",
  "A journal: 'Day 90. I sealed the notes away. / If the HOLLOW ORDER finds them, they will try to wake it.'",
  "VULK: Your fire burns bright! / Keep it lit, no matter how hard the wind blows."
 ],
 "pageErrors": []
